    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "I'm sorry to hear that, it must have been tough for you. Have a good rest.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-10T01:10:13.020293+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "It must have been tough for you. I hope you're doing okay and taking good care of yourself.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-10T01:12:12.303714+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "It was tough for you. You sound like you have a really tough day ahead. How is your health? I hope you are taking care of yourself.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-10T01:14:35.187762+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Oh, you're really tough. I hope your health is better than what you said.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-10T01:25:11.696474+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Oh, I see. Well, thanks for your kind words! That really means a lot to me. It's always nice to hear compliments from friends. How are you feeling?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-10T01:31:19.419560+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Thanks, Emily. That's really sweet of you to say. You know, I've always appreciated it when people appreciate my yoga practice.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-10T01:38:48.952017+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Thanks, Olivia. That's really sweet of you to say, and it's nice to know that I have that kind of appreciation from people.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-10T01:43:45.362610+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Emily, your kind words are really appreciated! It's always nice to hear compliments from friends.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-10T01:51:13.333526+00:00"
    },
